      "criterion": "Correctly differentiates the dT/dTpa vaccine schedule between CDC and Brazilian PNI guidelines: CDC recommends for individuals with unknown or incomplete vaccination 1 dose of Tdap followed by boosters every 10 years, while PNI (Brazil) suggests a primary series of 3 doses\u2014two doses 2 months apart (using dTpa or a combination of dTpa and dT), followed by a booster every 10 years. (Justification: This clarification is relevant and helps align users with the correct protocol depending on the guideline in use.)",
